  biomeName: Sand-Fan Deltas
  minDepthMeters: 0
  maxDepthMeters: 300
  shortDescription: Fractal tidal sediment patterns that change after every storm.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Early exploration biome. Come here to learn routes, gather basics,
    and keep orientation in soft terrain and hunt hidden value.
  commonRewardHook: Common runs pay out in Silica Shards and Copper Ore.
  rareRewardHook: 'Rare pull is modest: Electrolyte Salts and Sealant Pack.'
  landmarkIdentity: Sand-Fan Deltas reads through dunes, plains, void cuts, and shape
    changes in the floor. Landmarks should feel bright and readable.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are frequent. The player should often see a clear
    reset point nearby.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: orientation loss and long empty recovery swims.
    Creature pressure stays low_to_medium.'
  extractionFocus: 'Broad sweep collection, light salvage, and scattered node stops.
    Early tier: keep runs short and accept longer sweeps and weaker orientation during
    gathering.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is basin lip or dune crest line. This slot
    should read through soft bowls and ripple seams; use silhouette changes to avoid
    getting lost in soft terrain.
